(7514480, 1200081, 182284, '<td valign="top">This was the first in line I love the color pop and the bokeh. If I had taken this shot, I may would have shown a little more of the tulip. Still a nice shot. 8</td>', 'This was the first in line I love the color pop and the bokeh. If I had taken this shot, I may would have shown a little more of the tulip. Still a nice shot. 8', '2017-05-18 18:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7514486, 1199658, 182284, '<td valign="top">Clearly a beautiful shot of spring time with mamas and babies. I would like to have seen this with more of background. I still love this shot, it is clean, clear and the colors are awesome. 9</td>', 'Clearly a beautiful shot of spring time with mamas and babies. I would like to have seen this with more of background. I still love this shot, it is clean, clear and the colors are awesome. 9', '2017-05-18 18:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7514489, 1199907, 182284, '<td valign="top">I truly love the beautiful colors in this photo and the sharp focal point of the lower flowers. I think this would be the perfect shot if you could have isolated the lower branch of flowers from the ones on top, they tend to be a little distracting. You did a great shot capturing a breath of spring. 7</td>', 'I truly love the beautiful colors in this photo and the sharp focal point of the lower flowers. I think this would be the perfect shot if you could have isolated the lower branch of flowers from the ones on top, they tend to be a little distracting. You did a great shot capturing a breath of spring. 7', '2017-05-18 18:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7514490, 1199740, 182284, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of this shot and the fencing that borders the big tree. I think I would have stood further back and captured the entire tree. Still a beautiful shot of aproaching fall. Nice colors and composition.</td>', 'I like the concept of this shot and the fencing that borders the big tree. I think I would have stood further back and captured the entire tree. Still a beautiful shot of aproaching fall. Nice colors and composition.', '2017-05-18 18:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
