(7514493, 1199829, 182284, '<td valign="top">I call this season "The Greening of Spring". You have captured a very nice shot of spring green. There seems to be just a little distortion, other than that it is a very nice shot.</td>', 'I call this season "The Greening of Spring". You have captured a very nice shot of spring green. There seems to be just a little distortion, other than that it is a very nice shot.', '2017-05-18 18:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
