(7515175, 1200083, 182284, '<td valign="top">Oh my what a treat! I''ve never seen these before. Nice shot and looks like spring has sprung. I don''t know if this was taken as a soft shot which may be the case, but I would like to have seen it just a little sharper. Still a nice shot. 7</td>', 'Oh my what a treat! I''ve never seen these before. Nice shot and looks like spring has sprung. I don''t know if this was taken as a soft shot which may be the case, but I would like to have seen it just a little sharper. Still a nice shot. 7', '2017-05-23 01:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515176, 1199935, 182284, '<td valign="top">I love this color of lilies. This is a beautiful close-up shot, I think if I had taken this shot, I would have placed the leaf in front of the second lily behind that lily. The leaves across the second lily are a bit distracting. Still, it''s a very nice shot.<br/>I give it 7. I wish mine were th yellow ones.</td>', 'I love this color of lilies. This is a beautiful close-up shot, I think if I had taken this shot, I would have placed the leaf in front of the second lily behind that lily. The leaves across the second lily are a bit distracting. Still, it''s a very nice shot.I give it 7. I wish mine were th yellow ones.', '2017-05-23 01:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515177, 1199963, 182284, '<td valign="top">Very creative shot! I do like your process and clearly showing advances of fall. The Radial blur makes me want to look deeper into the photo. Very effective process. I don''t know if you have any control over the background on top of the leaves, but the structure is just a little distracting, I still give you 7 for this creative photo.</td>', 'Very creative shot! I do like your process and clearly showing advances of fall. The Radial blur makes me want to look deeper into the photo. Very effective process. I don''t know if you have any control over the background on top of the leaves, but the structure is just a little distracting, I still give you 7 for this creative photo.', '2017-05-23 01:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7515178, 1200087, 182284, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot and I love the bokeh. I would love to know how you can consistantly catch such beautiful bokeh. Please share your tecnique. This should do quite well. 8</td>', 'Beautiful shot and I love the bokeh. I would love to know how you can consistantly catch such beautiful bokeh. Please share your tecnique. This should do quite well. 8', '2017-05-23 01:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
