(7515349, 1199766, 28742, '<td valign="top">Welcome to DPC, Jon. This didn''t score well, but it''s not that bad. I gave it a 6. Hope you''ll continue to enter challenges and join the discussions in the forums and comment on others'' photos. Participation is the key to learning here. <br/> <br/>Cheers.</td>', 'Welcome to DPC, Jon. This didn''t score well, but it''s not that bad. I gave it a 6. Hope you''ll continue to enter challenges and join the discussions in the forums and comment on others'' photos. Participation is the key to learning here.  Cheers.', '2017-05-24 05:07:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7515352, 1200083, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>Ah, a welcome return to these fascinating birds, I do love these owls, its especially nice to see the young too. Your composition is very effective, I love the way all the young are posing directly at the camera, youve got them well trained! I see from the DOF and the aperture that you were at the higher end of your lens, just as well you didnt have to get too close. The only thing that mars it for me is that the grass feels over saturated. Anyway, congratulations on the ribbon, a lovely image Janine.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge Ah, a welcome return to these fascinating birds, I do love these owls, its especially nice to see the young too. Your composition is very effective, I love the way all the young are posing directly at the camera, youve got them well trained! I see from the DOF and the aperture that you were at the higher end of your lens, just as well you didnt have to get too close. The only thing that mars it for me is that the grass feels over saturated. Anyway, congratulations on the ribbon, a lovely image Janine.', '2017-05-24 06:30:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7515353, 1200096, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An image that meets the challenge<br/> <br/>These lovely flowers certainly suggest spring has definitely sprung Whilst the emphasis is certainly on the attractive springtime flowers it lacks a strong focal point. I see this is your first use of this lovely wide angle lens so its all part of the learning curve but I hope you will soon explore the creative potential of the lens. You can get amazingly close and anything close to the lens gets exaggerated so if you had gone in close on one of these flowers it would have formed a very strong focal point and improved the image enormously. Also I see you have used f22 and with that shutter speed presumably a tripod? An aperture of about f8 would have given you sufficient DOF and enabled you to hand hold it. I hope you enjoy using and discovering the creative potential in your lens Susie, thanks for your entry</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An image that meets the challenge These lovely flowers certainly suggest spring has definitely sprung Whilst the emphasis is certainly on the attractive springtime flowers it lacks a strong focal point. I see this is your first use of this lovely wide angle lens so its all part of the learning curve but I hope you will soon explore the creative potential of the lens. You can get amazingly close and anything close to the lens gets exaggerated so if you had gone in close on one of these flowers it would have formed a very strong focal point and improved the image enormously. Also I see you have used f22 and with that shutter speed presumably a tripod? An aperture of about f8 would have given you sufficient DOF and enabled you to hand hold it. I hope you enjoy using and discovering the creative potential in your lens Susie, thanks for your entry', '2017-05-24 06:41:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(7515354, 1200072, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An image that meets the challenge<br/> <br/>The presence of so many lambs is certainly indicative of a springtime scene which fulfils the challenge brief. I like the shapes and contrasts of the landscape it adds nicely to the overall result, but the lighting leaves a bit to be desired perhaps earlier or later with longer shadows would have enhanced it some. Thanks for your entry Jonathon</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An image that meets the challenge The presence of so many lambs is certainly indicative of a springtime scene which fulfils the challenge brief. I like the shapes and contrasts of the landscape it adds nicely to the overall result, but the lighting leaves a bit to be desired perhaps earlier or later with longer shadows would have enhanced it some. Thanks for your entry Jonathon', '2017-05-24 06:48:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7515355, 1200081, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge<br/> <br/>Welcome to DPC Patrick and what a commendable start. These lovely flowers are a welcome sign of spring thus fulfilling the challenge brief. I like your shallow DOF that accurately portrays the single flower against the foreground and background of soft focus repetition of blooms, nicely and creatively done. The distant blue contrasts nicely too and the lighting highlights on the flower give it an additional glowing appeal. Thanks for your entry</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge Welcome to DPC Patrick and what a commendable start. These lovely flowers are a welcome sign of spring thus fulfilling the challenge brief. I like your shallow DOF that accurately portrays the single flower against the foreground and background of soft focus repetition of blooms, nicely and creatively done. The distant blue contrasts nicely too and the lighting highlights on the flower give it an additional glowing appeal. Thanks for your entry', '2017-05-24 06:55:37.000000', NULL, 0),
